决。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实的", "context": "函子性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据，待决。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "下降数据的数学名词，待决。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "下降数据范畴，待决。"}], "notes": []}
